1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,410
Naukri nahi mili yaar... ab ghar kaise chalega?

2
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:07,922
Arre Abdul! Rona band kar. Tyre puncture ki dukaan khol le!

3
00:00:08,222 --> 00:00:11,654
Puncture ki dukaan? Usme kitna paisa lagega, Chacha?

4
00:00:11,954 --> 00:00:16,336
Bas 50 hazaar. Ek compressor, tool kit, aur tubeless kit.

5
00:00:16,636 --> 00:00:23,261
Dukaan highway ya petrol pump ke paas kholna. Wahin gaadiyan sabse zyada puncture hoti hain.

6
00:00:23,811 --> 00:00:27,776
Bhaiya jaldi karo! Gaadi puncture hai, shaadi mein jaana hai!

7
00:00:28,076 --> 00:00:31,419
Das minute, sahab. Car ka 150, bike ka 60.

8
00:00:31,719 --> 00:00:36,925
Roz 15-20 gaadiyan, yaani ₹1,500 se ₹2,500 roz ki kamai.

9
00:00:37,225 --> 00:00:43,489
Tyre-tube bechna, hawa bharna, sab extra kamai. Subah jaldi kholo, der se band karo.

10
00:00:43,789 --> 00:00:47,057
Mahine ke 50-60 hazaar! Abdul ki life set!
